Package: cfit
Title: Computational Finance Tools for Community Financial Institutions
Version: 0.2.7
Authors@R: 
    person("Colin", "Paterson", , "colinlpaterson@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides transparent, reproducible computational tools for solving 
    financial problems encountered by community banks and credit unions.
    Includes functions for prepayment analysis, loan cash flow generation, 
    duration, convexity, and weighted average life analysis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
URL: https://github.com/CommunityFIT/cfit
BugReports: https://github.com/CommunityFIT/cfit/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    lubridate,
    purrr,
    tibble
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
